        "channelId": "UCG-tejEoe7iUMoaBpISnqhA",
        "title": "Inland Knights - Drop Music in the Mix, Vol.1 (DJ Mix Album)",
        "description": "A seamless journey through the Drop Music catalogue, curated and mixed by Inland Knights. Drop Music In The Mix, Vol. 1 brings together a selection of classic cuts and deep underground gems, blended into one continuous DJ mix.\n\nBuilt for the dancefloor and the after-hours, this mix captures the essence of the Drop sound — rolling grooves, warm basslines, and timeless house energy from one of the UK’s most respected labels.\n\nFeaturing standout tracks from Inland Knights, alongside contributions from Larry Fives, Di Saronno, and Crazy P, this is a true snapshot of the label’s signature style.\n\n🔊 Timeless grooves. Underground energy.\n\n🎧 Tracklist\n00:00 Inland Knights – Cloud 99\n04:12 Inland Knights – Wait A Minute\n08:17 Larry Fives – Make A Move\n13:09 Inland Knights – I Feel This Way\n17:45 Inland Knights – The Game\n21:20 Inland Knights – Same Talk\n26:13 Inland Knights – Over You\n28:38 Inland Knights – Walk On\n33:15 Inland Knights – Situations\n39:23 Inland Knights – Make Me Feel\n44:00 Inland Knights – Over Night\n48:21 Inland Knights – Back Chat\n51:25 Inland Knights – In My Car\n56:17 Inland Knights – Not Crazey\n01:01:09 Di Saronno – Out of Control\n01:04:59 Inland Knights – 12 Till 8\n01:11:00 Crazy P – Disc Odyssey\n01:16:23 Inland Knights – Push It\n01:23:48 Inland Knights – Mikes Garage Mix\n\n#inlandknights #housemusic #90shouse #00shouse #djmix",
